## Command

```shell
biome lint '<TEMP_DIR>/child_plugin_includes_are_relative_to_child_config'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{ "root": true }
```

## `packages/mobile/biome.json`

```json
{
  "root": false,
  "plugins": [
    {
      "path": "./biome/root-relative.grit",
      "includes": ["packages/mobile/src/**"]
    },
    { "path": "./biome/child-relative.grit", "includes": ["src/**"] }
  ]
}
```

## `packages/mobile/biome/child-relative.grit`

```grit
`Object.assign($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $args, message = "Pattern relative to the child directory")
}
```

## `packages/mobile/biome/root-relative.grit`

```grit
`Object.assign($args)` where {
    register_diagnostic(span = $args, message = "Pattern relative to the root directory")
}
```

